  "_README": [
    "What a user typically reaches for after an operator of each group.",
    "",
    "Keyed by operatorGroupName; values are userFriendlyName, exactly as the",
    "palette shows them. Order matters: the first entry is offered first.",
    "",
    "Where Texera's own example workflows (bin/single-node/examples/workflows)",
    "link one group to an operator, that operator is placed first: those links",
    "are real decisions about what follows what. Groups those examples never",
    "reach carry reasoned defaults rather than observed ones.",
    "",
    "Groups that end a workflow map to an empty list, which is a statement",
    "rather than an omission: nothing follows a chart.",
    "",
    "Names that match no operator are reported in the browser console."
